{"4673810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Convent Of Magical Chambers", "steam_appid": 4673810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Eriqua, </strong>a curious girl who finds a magical hat that turns her into a witch.<br>Explore a seemingly abandoned Convent full of magic and discover the reason of its decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interconnected level design with lots of hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sim elements and branching narrative progression, there are consequences for how you act, good of bad!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons and chambers that may seem abstract and often unconventional and play your own way with immersive sim elements that let you progress by using your imagination to solve magical problems!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro inspired visuals reminiscent of old Unreal with handpainted textures and vibrant light</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is set in a fictional rural Portugal where <strong>Eriqua </strong>seems to be the only one capable of using magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can use her powers to help others, or do nothing.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Eriqua, </strong>a curious girl who finds a magical hat that turns her into a witch.<br>Explore a seemingly abandoned Convent full of magic and discover the reason of its decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interconnected level design with lots of hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sim elements and branching narrative progression, there are consequences for how you act, good of bad!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons and chambers that may seem abstract and often unconventional and play your own way with immersive sim elements that let you progress by using your imagination to solve magical problems!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro inspired visuals reminiscent of old Unreal with handpainted textures and vibrant light</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is set in a fictional rural Portugal where <strong>Eriqua </strong>seems to be the only one capable of using magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can use her powers to help others, or do nothing.</p>", "short_description": "3D adventure Immersive sim inspired by the early 2000s level design, explore an abandoned convent filled with ghosts and magical chambers and try to solve the mystery behind the creation of the chambers.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Danish, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Vietnamese, Arabic, Czech, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Romanian, Russian, Swedish, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673810/72f2feff409f2835a73e2b108643dc6bd6c56adc/header.jpg?t=1783622317", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673810/7e3676c8422a84b48df5801ab76a7fd5ba134c2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783622317", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673810/7e3676c8422a84b48df5801ab76a7fd5ba134c2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783622317", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB availab